# shellcheck settings for this repository (picked up automatically).
# box-hardening.sh is split into lib/*.sh modules that share globals, so
# per-file "unused"/"unassigned" warnings are noise:
#   SC2034 variable appears unused     SC2154 variable referenced but not assigned
#   SC2153 possible misspelling
# Two idioms are used on purpose throughout:
#   SC2015 `[ test ] && [ test ] || { fail; }` guard clauses
#   SC2016 single-quoted `sh -c '... "$1" ...'` whose $1 belongs to the inner shell
disable=SC2034,SC2154,SC2153,SC2015,SC2016
